1
00:00:00,211 --> 00:00:01,771
(Raj:)No. Not really.

2
00:00:04,949 --> 00:00:10,079
(Penny:)- Come on, Raj, not even a little bit?
- Not that I can think of.

3
00:00:11,756 --> 00:00:14,086
(Bernadette:)Think harder.

4
00:00:15,926 --> 00:00:19,056
(Raj:)Nope. I guess the heart wants
what the heart wants.

5
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:22,960
(Raj:)Or in this case, doesn't. I mean, at all.

6
00:00:26,203 --> 00:00:27,433
(Raj:)What?

7
00:00:29,874 --> 00:00:35,144
(Sheldon:)Ye who now will bless the poor
Shall yourselves find blessing

8
00:00:35,312 --> 00:00:36,332
Ba-da-bum!

9
00:00:39,283 --> 00:00:40,303
(Howard:)Done?

10
00:00:40,484 --> 00:00:43,114
(Sheldon:)I think the word you're looking for
is "bravo."

11
00:00:44,221 --> 00:00:48,851
(Leonard:)Okay, you leave the room and find yourself
standing before a pool of melted snowmen.

12
00:00:49,026 --> 00:00:52,356
(Sheldon:)Melted snowmen? Are there carrots
and lumps of coal in the water?

13
00:00:52,530 --> 00:00:55,660
- Uh, what's the difference?
- It's a game of the imagination, Leonard.

14
00:00:55,833 --> 00:00:58,803
(Sheldon:)- Paint a picture.
- Fine. You leave the room and find yourself...

